+
+#### [Unstructured](https://github.com/Unstructured-IO/unstructured)
+> **Description:** Unstructured focuses on ingesting and transforming raw documents into cleaner elements that can feed search, analytics, and LLM systems. The README highlights connectors, partitioning strategies, and support for complex enterprise document types, which is directly relevant when tax teams need to normalize engagement letters, organizer responses, notices, invoices, and research memos. It is especially useful as a middle layer between raw files and a knowledge base. GitHub showed active 2026 development, Python as the dominant language, and an Apache-2.0 license.
+
