+- **Stars:** 11.7k ⭐
+- **Language:** Python
+- **License:** Apache-2.0
+- **Last Commit:** 2026-03-30
+- **Category:** document parsing, ETL, RAG
+- **Best for:** normalizing mixed tax documents into chunkable content
+
