+#### [Docling](https://github.com/docling-project/docling)
+> **Description:** Docling is positioned as a document processing toolkit that gets files ready for generative AI. Its README stresses advanced PDF understanding, diverse format support, and smooth integration with the GenAI ecosystem, which maps well to tax document intake where source material ranges from statements to scanned correspondence. The project is strong when you need structured output instead of just plain OCR text. GitHub showed MIT licensing, Python as the primary language, and active commits in 2026.
+
