+
+#### [Marker](https://github.com/VikParuchuri/marker)
+> **Description:** Marker converts PDFs into Markdown and JSON with a heavy focus on accuracy and clean downstream output. The README is explicit that the project is built for fast conversion and high-fidelity extraction, including layouts that matter when a tax team needs to preserve sections, tables, and citations from source material. It is a strong fit for converting research documents, memos, and form instructions into formats that are easier to search and compare. GitHub showed Python as primary, GPL-3.0 licensing, and fresh 2026 activity.
